/**
 * Fills gaps in existing records: soil pH and type, mature size, root and
 * sowing depth, feeding, pests, diseases, watering, harvesting and yield.
 * Applied by scripts/build-plant-data.mjs. A value is only used where the
 * record has none, so hand-written data always wins.
 *
 * Values are editorial ranges from widely published horticultural guidance
 * (Nordic where possible). Pest and disease notes are shared per crop group
 * and name the problems most gardeners in Finland actually meet.
 */

